{"time": 1751857111, "type": "reply", "message_id": "126412681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "开始记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1751857244, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1906192926", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "不论刮风下雨，太阳照常升起。但与云层下的世界无关"}
{"time": 1751857267, "type": "recv", "message_id": "972146736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（等醒来再哭泣）"}
{"time": 1751857286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1784218459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你们各自醒来，今天云层有些厚重，像是要下雨"}
{"time": 1751857308, "type": "recv", "message_id": "442112204", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（话说saki也在池子睡了一夜？）"}
{"time": 1751857321, "type": "recv", "message_id": "309530177", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（应该不吧，在岸边）"}
{"time": 1751857432, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2073871470", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "起身看看"}
{"time": 1751857465, "type": "recv", "message_id": "504425953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=442112204]你在温热的温泉中醒来，扭头一看，saki蜷缩在池边，惬意地打着呼噜"}
{"time": 1751857501, "type": "recv", "message_id": "719072732", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "醒来，伸个懒腰“好舒服....感觉疲劳都消失了”"}
{"time": 1751857522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "642947211", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "把saki叫醒“该走了，起床喵”"}
{"time": 1751857606, "type": "recv", "message_id": "803143217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2073871470]芦苇荡沙沙作响，夏弥还躺在你腿上，看起来是睡着了。不远处的湖面偶尔传来鱼儿跃出水面的声音"}
{"time": 1751857705, "type": "recv", "message_id": "513166645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=642947211]“喵……早上了喵？”saki揉揉眼睛，睡得快醒的也快，不得不说是一种宝贵的技能"}
{"time": 1751857755, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1056892242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...失败了吗？\"轻轻嘟囔一句，\"也没什么想做的...\"看看天色似乎快要下雨，但也不想弄醒夏弥，轻轻抚过她的头发，继续看湖和远处的山。"}
{"time": 1751857781, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1700827129", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "穿好衣服，收拾好行装，朝铁匠铺进发"}
{"time": 1751858038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "740979233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1056892242]今天的空气似乎格外湿润，你的剑鞘上结了一层薄霜。高草之间偶有虫鸣鸟叫。湖面上偶有波纹，不知是鱼吐的泡泡还是偶有雨点落下"}
{"time": 1751858065, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1775829977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1700827129]那你很快到了铁匠铺"}
{"time": 1751858089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "602437167", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=740979233]说起来，你连昨天的晚饭都没吃"}
{"time": 1751858105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2073299475", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看铁匠开始上班了吗"}
{"time": 1751858176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1994880793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "已经有叮叮当当的敲打声响起了，柜台后面，铁匠大叔一如往常地在做一些不需要加热的小工艺"}
{"time": 1751858192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1588881214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（总之，铁匠铺里肯定是不止一个人的）"}
{"time": 1751858207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1707192176", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我还以为是他压榨艾露猫（）"}
{"time": 1751858221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "382846870", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“大叔，我又来了”"}
{"time": 1751858231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1753332396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "此刻自己装着工具和食物的包又不在自己这里，先饿着吧，倒也不是不能忍。低下头有些茫然地看着面前的湖水，“...下雨了吗？”"}
{"time": 1751858361, "type": "recv", "message_id": "517831832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=382846870]“噢，露儿来了。这几天来的真频繁，看起来收获不少啊。今天要打什么？”"}
{"time": 1751858447, "type": "recv", "message_id": "242609517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "把收集的素材都拿出来“这些人鱼龙的鳞片和牙够单独打造一把刀和盔甲吗，大叔”"}
{"time": 1751858544, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1038828069", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1753332396]你感觉手背传来一点凉意，确实有雨点在稀疏地落下"}
{"time": 1751858644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "854163071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "抱起夏弥，在附近找一棵树坐下。"}
{"time": 1751858753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1836576828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "低头看看左边手心的伤口，靠在树上，心情就像这将落未落大雨的阴郁天空。"}
{"time": 1751858797, "type": "recv", "message_id": "762892562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"茫然啊...\"吐出几个字，看看树叶够不够挡雨"}
{"time": 1751858802, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1831766386", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=242609517]“人鱼龙啊……可不是好对付的家伙。厉害啊”铁匠啧啧称奇“不过这些……没有睡眠囊啊，打出来的武器会差点意思。没有发鳍的话，防具也大概只够胸甲和臂甲的份”"}
{"time": 1751858883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "561788399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这还有些水兽的素材，混合一下用吧”"}
{"time": 1751858931, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1438022891", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=762892562]“嗯……怎么了？”夏弥悠悠醒转，脑袋在你的怀抱中蹭了蹭"}
{"time": 1751858971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "948891770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=762892562]看雨的大小.jpg"}
{"time": 1751859025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1628440121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（哎，要不再去把人鱼龙尸体掏一遍去）"}
{"time": 1751859082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2003768117", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=561788399]“嗯……那应该够用了”铁匠点点头“加工费的话，算你4600z”"}
{"time": 1751859095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1924618039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1628440121]（随你）"}
{"time": 1751859100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1630564798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1438022891]\"感觉...不知道能干什么。而且，小狐狸也弄丢了。\""}
{"time": 1751859114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "934927957", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好，谢谢大叔”付钱"}
{"time": 1751859232, "type": "recv", "message_id": "991122332", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1630564798]“哦呀，一向干劲满满的安也会这样吗？”夏弥坐了起来“我还以为你总能找到事做……”"}
{"time": 1751859297, "type": "recv", "message_id": "668900435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=991122332]“不过我过往的生活里，大部分时间都没什么事做，只是活着而已……所以这方面没法出谋划策啦……”"}
{"time": 1751859301, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1952014489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对了大叔，你知道有没有那种专门卖艾露猫相关物品的店”"}
{"time": 1751859347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "577892813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=934927957]“明天下午来取吧……艾露猫的用品？具体是哪种？”"}
{"time": 1751859382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2087395785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“偏日常的吧，衣服，窝之类的”"}
{"time": 1751859491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "842189941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=65AAD9155B5AC5725607C4D16BF7F9C7.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTXlx6XDoP4_zoWh1r6US8lsMB4EBjx6AIg_woo6PL0lOmpjgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQaEcRzjBEpnzz35q7WuEW9noCMk0&amp;rkey=CAISMEvBomfRlEG0I14VmqPbIyrdR9OpOhMpeaLGxrQGoGMopMfctyudm-b73vb6otGBAA,file_size=46193]"}
