{"time": 1751859496, "type": "recv", "message_id": "238604661", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（原来是龙p）"}
{"time": 1751859505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1185603349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你才知道？）"}
{"time": 1751859514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1958883641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=48D4C5E4CA834CDC40C7338C6E1B04CD.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQgXzDTkZ4NT5VlYj6MW1DpVrfzjBiHlwEg_wookI_mn-mpjgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ93K7X684oLKxBi1YGMYkDXoCKF0&amp;rkey=CAISMEvBomfRlEG0I14VmqPbIyrdR9OpOhMpeaLGxrQGoGMopMfctyudm-b73vb6otGBAA,file_size=19335]"}
{"time": 1751859521, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1891980292", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我没看过龙族）"}
{"time": 1751859546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1158974322", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（评价是美味的史）"}
{"time": 1751859573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "911338393", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=668900435]抿抿嘴，\"虽然知道急不得就是，但是这段时间总感觉一事无成...\"垂眸，语气低落。"}
{"time": 1751859585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "798281099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我跟路明非没什么好说的)"}
{"time": 1751859596, "type": "recv", "message_id": "824852407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(南昌路明非出列)"}
{"time": 1751859613, "type": "recv", "message_id": "316451162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢你大叔，再见”然后领着saki去专卖店"}
{"time": 1751859926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1488231761", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=911338393]“日子还长着，一直都有事做不会很累吗？”夏弥把住你的肩膀，帮你放倒在她的腿上，面朝着天空“偶尔也安心享受一下闲暇嘛”"}
{"time": 1751859956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1075621043", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（骑个车）"}
{"time": 1751860216, "type": "recv", "message_id": "208076234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1488231761]鼓起脸颊吐口气，\"想教导后辈，好像已经失败了，自己的事情也没什么眉目。\"转个身面着她蜷起身，\"昨天难得有点兴致想给夏弥抓只小狐狸，好像也...唔...\"停顿了一会，\"好累...\""}
