{"time": 1751895949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "992412019", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有些发抖“嘶..医生，她这个情况....怎么样”"}
