{"time": 1751905364, "type": "recv", "message_id": "161926785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=884750730]总之擦一擦血污，缠上绷带，把秘药碾碎洒在伤口。然后拿一套自己的衣服套上，可能小了一点，但是勉勉强强。做完应急处理之后，\"唔...之后该怎么交谈...\""}
{"time": 1751905374, "type": "recv", "message_id": "230980242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=2FDD6DB902DC27B98852332E3AC291E9.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSA639IGSys0Fe6zCbTggR6i9tOZBj54pcDIP8KKOKQiIyUq44DMgRwcm9kUIC9owFaEDZdnnai-wW2gfgICiJ-foB6AnkU&amp;rkey=CAESMOU5-Ej1VbE6tv2n5tQfy8Kgqe1s-j70FTbT5scDLiX4_SRgOHcis0kx7Fnr3BQspg,file_size=6680953]"}
{"time": 1751905383, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1189018295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（当然，没有角，你自己脑补一下）"}
{"time": 1751905404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "110131140", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好）"}
{"time": 1751905444, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1062510902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（哎，忽然想到你有张卡就是大卡（）"}
{"time": 1751905455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "572792191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（对啊）"}
{"time": 1751905472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2089660692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(是的)"}
{"time": 1751905474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2030508290", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=161926785]“拿着刀谈吧，大概”"}
{"time": 1751905550, "type": "recv", "message_id": "651940428", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"毫无头绪啊...这次是不是有些太任性了。\"去水里洗个手，走到夏弥身边轻轻靠着她"}
{"time": 1751905645, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1783279829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“现在说这个好像有点晚了……但这家伙也真是的……怎么那么拼命”"}
{"time": 1751905654, "type": "recv", "message_id": "817451422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“只要服软就好了啊”"}
{"time": 1751905692, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1148001236", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"有些拼过头了。\"皱着眉，\"这湖里有什么吗？\""}
{"time": 1751905719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "279180402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看一看这家伙的状态有没有好转"}
{"time": 1751905757, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1237637426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "依旧昏迷着，呼吸频率很低"}
{"time": 1751905829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1890615015", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "最大的问题仍然是失血，间接影响着药物的吸收速率"}
{"time": 1751905888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "951479737", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "已经做过应急处理，现在失的血似乎只能通过输血来填补了。"}
{"time": 1751905899, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1121237038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘶，夏弥，真的能吃什么补什么吗？\""}
{"time": 1751905911, "type": "recv", "message_id": "735401343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（感觉这时候没有输血这种科技（）"}
{"time": 1751905919, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1279778715", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（血型还没研究明白呢）"}
{"time": 1751905941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1805676309", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1121237038]“……起码我能吃铁补铁”"}
{"time": 1751906010, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1336200278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你要干什么？”"}
{"time": 1751906041, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1262395804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"再喂点血?\"眨眨眼，\"感觉我的血好像挺有用的样子。\""}
{"time": 1751906049, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1811882862", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=817451422]（其实这句话从普世价值观来说挺变态的（）"}
{"time": 1751906099, "type": "recv", "message_id": "290420599", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“或许……？”夏弥歪歪头，也不确定的样子"}
{"time": 1751906226, "type": "recv", "message_id": "822717180", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...先试试吧。\"咬破另一个手指，把她的嘴打开，往舌尖滴血。"}
{"time": 1751906242, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1914482639", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实我在想）"}
{"time": 1751906252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1462511849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（立绘用八重樱的事（）"}
{"time": 1751906289, "type": "recv", "message_id": "156783879", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=822717180]至少不用担心被吐出来，但暂时还是没有反应"}
{"time": 1751906358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "831328804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那个海龙醒来不会打我吧）"}
{"time": 1751906373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1974555399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我怎么知道）"}
{"time": 1751906384, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1964576532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这边醒来肯定要打一架的）"}
{"time": 1751906439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1960717206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...\"感觉有些头重脚轻，收回手，在她的伤口再洒点药粉，靠到夏弥身上，\"晕...\""}
{"time": 1751906445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "641285854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=156783879]夜幕早已降临，现在你们围在一小堆篝火边，看芦苇和火光一同摇曳"}
{"time": 1751906455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "32249870", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不知道的以为你是割腕了）"}
{"time": 1751906468, "type": "recv", "message_id": "596579328", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（指尖能流多少）"}
{"time": 1751906471, "type": "recv", "message_id": "12278942", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我这两天吐了好多血)"}
{"time": 1751906475, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1936197678", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(也正常吧)"}
{"time": 1751906480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1109342828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（丢人（）"}
{"time": 1751906493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "52557233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(回归大地了)"}
{"time": 1751906576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1575625222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "把烤鱼维持着合适的温度，烤着火软软地趴在夏弥怀里，\"不知道这家伙什么时候才能醒，不服的话，再打一顿?\""}
{"time": 1751906710, "type": "recv", "message_id": "417117048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1575625222]“好像也没有别的办法”夏弥轻轻挠你的下巴“不过安这几天是不是太卖力了？战斗方面还在起步期，却总是不让我”"}
{"time": 1751906715, "type": "recv", "message_id": "108592602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“插手”"}
{"time": 1751906806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "108769111", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"安想尽快成长起来。\"发出咕噜咕噜的声音，舒服地眯起眼睛。"}
{"time": 1751906831, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2042182673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"止步不前...会迷茫...帮不上大家的忙，难受...\""}
{"time": 1751906883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "786922248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“也不是只有站在最前方才算帮上忙？安就帮了夏弥很多忙”"}
{"time": 1751907066, "type": "recv", "message_id": "428759959", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "转过身看向夏弥，语气难得有些坚定，\"但是，夏弥知道的吧，遇到那家伙的话...\""}
{"time": 1751907087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1965785845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"安一定要站在最前面，才能保护大家。\""}
{"time": 1751907102, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1789969675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嘛……恐怕全世界也没有几个人能对付那家伙的……实在不行就……先跑”"}
{"time": 1751907229, "type": "recv", "message_id": "630329785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(原来是五六千)"}
{"time": 1751907231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "461347469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(五六七)"}
{"time": 1751907296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2067263625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1789969675]“上次我们也跑掉了不是吗？”"}
{"time": 1751907382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1162348221", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1789969675]翠色的眸子盯着夏弥，\"但是，夏弥...没人可以逃过自己的宿命。\"伸出手捏捏脸，\"就算是为了你，我也不能一直躲下去。\""}
{"time": 1751907412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1650969630", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "随后扭过头扑哧一笑，\"好啦好啦，不要那么紧张嘛夏弥，我相信我能赢的啦。\""}
{"time": 1751907537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1100424825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，我也相信。灵峰终究是会放晴的”"}
