{"time": 1751914243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1001135395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "走近一点，真诚地开口，\"请相信我没有恶意...只是...那时候有点任性了...对不起！\""}
{"time": 1751914255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "400256076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "递给她烤鱼，\"饿了吗？\""}
{"time": 1751914328, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1017207289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=833860028]随后她身体像是终于上上了发条，无意识地动了起来"}
{"time": 1751914631, "type": "recv", "message_id": "402385025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1001135395]“好个……没有恶意”她轻蔑地发笑“真是……可笑”"}
{"time": 1751914669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1126597937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"对不起...\""}
{"time": 1751914676, "type": "recv", "message_id": "765053058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1017207289]良久，她终于睁开那对与头发同色的海蓝双眸，眼神中尽是迷茫"}
{"time": 1751914714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "341009578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"想笑的话...我...不能反驳...\"比她本来就矮一些，此刻只敢平视她，不看眼睛"}
{"time": 1751914736, "type": "recv", "message_id": "119603851", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "递出烤鱼，\"...\""}
{"time": 1751914959, "type": "recv", "message_id": "750117607", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=119603851]“……”"}
{"time": 1751914964, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1656320372", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你们到底想干什么”"}
{"time": 1751915047, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1162279811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"想...让你和我们一起旅行。\""}
{"time": 1751915165, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1109354267", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你觉得可能吗？”"}
{"time": 1751915219, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1481604307", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...但是...这是我们的想法...\""}
{"time": 1751915236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1632183718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"对不起...所以你想做什么...我都同意..\""}
{"time": 1751915678, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1157067939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1632183718]“……”"}
{"time": 1751915704, "type": "recv", "message_id": "964506461", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好啊，我要……把我的疼痛，如数奉还”"}
{"time": 1751915812, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1732711336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "伸出手，\"...\""}
{"time": 1751915978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1591269234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她抽出破碎的太刀，剑刃崩裂如齿"}
{"time": 1751915994, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1156936825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "砍在人身上，恐怕不会和锯子有什么区别"}
{"time": 1751916119, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1877667591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...\"有些害怕地看着，尽管畏畏缩缩，但是还是站着没动。"}
{"time": 1751916247, "type": "recv", "message_id": "698674213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她无视了你，回身朝在她身后的夏弥砍去"}
{"time": 1751916253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1539681146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd+6-2"}
{"time": 1751916253, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1539681146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[张风辰]演奏出: d+6-2={15}+6-2=19"}
{"time": 1751916265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1774964928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd+8 格挡"}
{"time": 1751916265, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1774964928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[张风辰]使用[格挡]演奏出:[1D20+8={15}+8=23]"}
{"time": 1751916393, "type": "recv", "message_id": "596620165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "只听得铮然一声，长刀再次崩裂，而夏弥岿然不动"}
{"time": 1751916437, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1202804089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...不要动夏弥。\"立刻上前从后面扯住她，\"...现在我也不能为你做什么...昨天的事情都是我的任性导致的...有什么就冲着我来...\""}
{"time": 1751916574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "475065653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嘁……真是……怪物”她落寞地放下胳膊“早知道……在第一次接触的时候，就把你的脑袋咬下来……”"}
{"time": 1751916777, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1836892486", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] ）"}
{"time": 1751916780, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1885670558", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "摇摇头，\"你是善良的孩子...不会做那种事的...\""}
{"time": 1751916783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "311808351", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不是说要到五点吗）"}
{"time": 1751916789, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1201782817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怎么这么快就歇逼了）"}
{"time": 1751916795, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1839206167", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你忘了，每次翔哥)"}
{"time": 1751916798, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1385439733", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(说要到五点)"}
{"time": 1751916803, "type": "recv", "message_id": "685198603", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(都会)"}
{"time": 1751916809, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1755011590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(如此如此)"}
{"time": 1751916817, "type": "recv", "message_id": "484682482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（bin哥粉丝）"}
{"time": 1751916821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "898935504", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（天天骗我们）"}
{"time": 1751916858, "type": "recv", "message_id": "323862241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那你们呢？”"}
{"time": 1751916868, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1964595708", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1885670558]\"所以...因为我的任性...让你受了这么多罪...还奢求你..和我们一起旅行..\"翠色的眼睛里盛满歉意，但还是看向她，\"可以吗...\""}
{"time": 1751916880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "418353856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "第三次把烤鱼递给她"}
{"time": 1751917128, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1800274422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我拒绝”她言简意赅"}
{"time": 1751917205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1678806296", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "抿着嘴唇，\"可是...现在这个样子，请你跟着我们一起，好吗？我们也是因为...这个理由才等在这里...\""}
{"time": 1751917279, "type": "recv", "message_id": "542328389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那是你的事，与我无关。我们之间唯一有关系的，是我绝对不会遗忘的耻辱与伤痕”"}
{"time": 1751917390, "type": "recv", "message_id": "448059473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"如果就此离开的话，往后也不会有机会遗忘这耻辱和伤痕了吧。\"停顿，\"而且，我需要你的力量。\""}
{"time": 1751917480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1913871110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "一转语气，变得凛冽起来，\"昨天没有感觉到身体有什么不同吗？我的血对你起到了作用。\"目光直视，\"原因则是...\"指着天外的灵峰，\"那个存在。\""}
{"time": 1751917639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "772568217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我说的够明白了，不管你们是怎么想的……”她开始撕扯束缚住腿部的绳子“与我无关。我不会和一条鱼讲道理，你也不会真的把我当做同伴”"}
{"time": 1751917678, "type": "recv", "message_id": "135960527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"但是..我是认真的。\""}
{"time": 1751917808, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1061751340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"果然这一步是最麻烦的啊，但是既然已经走到了这一步，我不想就此放弃。\"深吸一口气，\"我想给这片天空带来晴天，为此，我需要众多的同伴。为此，可以相信我吗？\"再上前一步，捧起她的手放在自己脖子前"}
{"time": 1751917866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1277184546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我也是认真的——我讨厌你。山上的那位与我从无交恶。”"}
{"time": 1751917951, "type": "recv", "message_id": "475134749", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...我接受你的讨厌，但是我的目的不会变。\""}
{"time": 1751918088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1081598785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"即使是讨厌我也好，但是在现在这个情况下，我也不会有第二个选择。\"神色趋于平淡"}
{"time": 1751918313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "355042785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哈，露出狐狸尾巴了……真是，傲慢得令人作呕”绘梨衣的神色趋于厌恶，瞳孔的底色努力染上绯红"}
{"time": 1751918578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "194500140", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯，我已无意与你再做争论。\"没有动，\"但是我下决心之事，绝不变更。\"脑袋微微歪斜，盯着她，眼底里不再有额外的感情。"}
{"time": 1751918743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1096135823", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"说是傲慢也罢，厌恶也罢，我一并受之。既是无心，亦是有意，选择只做微小区分\""}
{"time": 1751918842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "255687529", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好啊——让我看看，你会怎么杀死我”"}
{"time": 1751919051, "type": "recv", "message_id": "718082456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我说过，我并无第二个选择。你将这当做傲慢，用你的原话奉回。\"停顿，\"我的选择，和你何干?\""}
{"time": 1751919336, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1327092274", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎白厄）"}
{"time": 1751919410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1135035214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(对的)"}
{"time": 1751919415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1870964128", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（so？）"}
{"time": 1751919454, "type": "recv", "message_id": "38893464", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "自然是绑住她的双手"}
