{"time": 1751954560, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1759902846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（感觉我今天是去不了了）"}
{"time": 1751954977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "996338455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1232897543]“动手的主要是我吧，没有那种立场”夏弥叹了口气“总感觉做错了什么”"}
{"time": 1751955033, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2028284573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=765053058][CQ:at,qq=825734198] “你终于醒了，昨天刚遇到你的时候吓死我了”"}
{"time": 1751955252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1394726653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2028284573]（原来她的眼睛应该是红色是）"}
{"time": 1751955386, "type": "recv", "message_id": "413798220", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你是……是你？”她回过神来，视线似乎还有些模糊，眼皮颤抖着眯上，似乎带着些危险气息，但很快便不再关注你。她从水中坐起，视线上上下下打量着自己的每一寸身体“怎么……回事……”"}
{"time": 1751955517, "type": "recv", "message_id": "354121487", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你....认识我？我们见过吗”有些疑惑“对了，你叫什么，我叫岩垣露，叫我小露或者露儿都可以，你怎么会受那么的伤还漂在湖上”"}
{"time": 1751955705, "type": "recv", "message_id": "741474751", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她没有理会你，只是从浴缸里起身，令人印象深刻的身材毫无保留地暴露在空气中。她胯部走出，问了个简单的问题“海……在哪边？”"}
{"time": 1751955717, "type": "recv", "message_id": "76621488", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她没有理会你，只是从浴缸里起身，令人印象深刻的身材毫无保留地暴露在空气中。她跨步走出，问了个简单的问题“海……在哪边？”"}
{"time": 1751955752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1010673268", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你现在要休息吧,去海边干什么”"}
{"time": 1751955813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "857419020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“是有什么东西落在那里了吗，我可以帮你去取”"}
{"time": 1751955986, "type": "recv", "message_id": "727356248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我要去战斗”她俯视着你，言简意赅"}
{"time": 1751956014, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1610543483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你受这么重的伤，怎么去战斗，先休息吧，医生你也说说她”"}
{"time": 1751956228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "350743365", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“疯了”蝴蝶夫人也言简意赅地评价“我知道你可能是强大的猎人，你的体质不一般，但你现在这个样子，能做什么？你连装备都没了”她从背后用舀水用的勺子轻轻杵了杵她受伤的身侧"}
{"time": 1751956492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2029505175", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "奇异的事发生了——高大女性被戳到痛处（物理），不免向另一侧一扭，面目扭曲的同时倒吸一口凉气。但下一刻，深蓝色的全身甲胄在身体表面凭空浮现，覆盖着尖锐腕甲的右手摘向那长柄木勺"}
{"time": 1751956510, "type": "recv", "message_id": "763140708", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？”"}
{"time": 1751956536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "200166066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "但唯独，那被雷击过一般的右侧身体，没有甲胄覆盖，就像甲胄与她承担了同等伤害"}
{"time": 1751956583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1116492029", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“什……”蝴蝶夫人被突如其来的变化冲击得一愣，木勺自然也毫无悬念地被夺走"}
{"time": 1751956604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "446700014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（原来你也是魔法少女（）"}
{"time": 1751956668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "680098886", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你...你要干嘛”"}
{"time": 1751956673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1526108415", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你是什么东西？”蝴蝶夫人眯起眼，好奇心与警惕心同时熊熊燃烧"}
{"time": 1751956713, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1118449771", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "至少现在，尽管负伤，但着甲的人仍有压倒性的战斗力优势"}
{"time": 1751956803, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1394354319", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“告诉我……海在哪……”她似乎有些气短，说话都有些断断续续，她皱眉，不知是因为疼痛还是不耐"}
{"time": 1751956983, "type": "recv", "message_id": "845104589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不行，总之你不能走”"}
{"time": 1751957016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1365152710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1751957021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "527499666", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（总之是？）"}
{"time": 1751957174, "type": "recv", "message_id": "75636328", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你先养伤，你要去打谁，我...我帮你打”"}
{"time": 1751957378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1768702609", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你？”她的目光短暂停留“太弱了……海中的龙……你做不到”"}
{"time": 1751957397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1322541149", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那也比现在的你厉害”"}
{"time": 1751957397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1904259096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我发现你到现在都没说过是你救的她，哈哈）"}
