{"time": 1751959355, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1965574358", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=784937820]“不用，小栗会帮忙准备”"}
{"time": 1751959390, "type": "recv", "message_id": "458867616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我去帮她买一身衣服吧...总不能一直这样”"}
{"time": 1751959463, "type": "recv", "message_id": "247885929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……”蝴蝶夫人围着盔甲女人转了两圈，指尖时不时在她盔甲上轻轻敲敲“哦，记得买宽大一点的，嗯……”"}
{"time": 1751959574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1607846970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "随后她蹲下来，在低着头的女人面前挥挥手“你好，我叫蝴蝶，是你的医生——你知道医生是什么意思吗？”"}
{"time": 1751959587, "type": "recv", "message_id": "471117161", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我...我知道了”目测一下她衣服尺码"}
