{"time": 1751960269, "type": "recv", "message_id": "743804322", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=996338455]\"嗯...\"叹口气，\"以后再也不会做这种事了，对不起，夏弥，把你卷进我的任性里...\""}
{"time": 1751960277, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1284731442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（反正迟早要买的）"}
{"time": 1751960425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1571054646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1816614228]“嗯……一般来讲是。”蝴蝶夫人点点头“不过她很特殊”"}
{"time": 1751960526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1410732001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=743804322]“不用向我道歉啦，我们是共犯”她摇摇头“不过这下应该……彻底没法当宠物养了吧”"}
{"time": 1751960631, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1984128535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“确实挺特殊的...她后来有说什么吗”"}
