{"time": 1751960943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2137083387", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1135866271]“她呢？”"}
{"time": 1751960966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1689178189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"弄成这样，不好放着不管吧？\""}
{"time": 1751961152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1238655033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1833525658]“嗯……不知道发生了什么，也不知道她的甲胄是哪来的……全身上下都是谜团啊”蝴蝶换完了药，拉着你到一旁坐下"}
{"time": 1751961225, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1192477334", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1689178189]“嗯……也是。回去找医生想想办法吧”"}
{"time": 1751961377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "181631961", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1238655033]“小栗的粥应该也快好了，在这等一会吧”蝴蝶打了个哈欠“她好像认识你？”"}
