{"time": 1751962593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "167480952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“啊？”"}
{"time": 1751962625, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1128684816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个医生，会不会是她这里出问题了，想不起来过去了”指了指头"}
{"time": 1751962833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2005366730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1128684816]“不排除这种可能，溺水缺氧确实会对大脑造成损伤……啊，粥来了”小栗双手加头一起撑起一个大托盘，上面放着三碗热气腾腾的肉粥"}
{"time": 1751962961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "982843313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1689178189]总之，大概10点左右会回到村子里吧"}
{"time": 1751962964, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1417790051", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢医生”接过来 然后往那名女子面前摆一碗粥"}
{"time": 1751962994, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1806463946", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你是不是想不起来自己叫什么名字了，那我先给你起个名字怎么样..”"}
{"time": 1751963156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1711904062", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1806463946]“随便……”比起你们，现在她显然对自己面前的食物更感兴趣"}
