{"time": 1751971368, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1530329968", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=716074412]“嗯……起码想做的事都做完了吧？”她抱着你滑入池子里“之后……静待花开就好”"}
{"time": 1751971486, "type": "recv", "message_id": "274703245", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1249516384]“这幅身体……虽然方便，但是好……弱小”她屈伸着自己的胳膊"}
{"time": 1751971574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "544294253", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1530329968]\"嗯...希望这一切都有意义...\"搂着夏弥，脑袋搭在她胸前，\"不过...以后不会再做这种事了...呜呜呜...夏弥..安被她凶了好久。\""}
{"time": 1751971610, "type": "recv", "message_id": "766612012", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=274703245][CQ:at,qq=825734198] “习惯了之后你就知道当人的好了”"}
{"time": 1751971621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1298291892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“比如刚刚那些吃的还不算最好吃的”"}
{"time": 1751971752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "177875872", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=544294253]“好嘛好嘛……我会补偿你的”她揉揉你的脑袋“不过，这家伙……不论脾气还是实力，好像都有些出乎意料啊”"}
{"time": 1751971784, "type": "recv", "message_id": "497931750", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过现在最重要的还是养好身体”"}
{"time": 1751971839, "type": "recv", "message_id": "114368117", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=177875872]\"嗯...安也完全没想到。\"看着自己全是伤口的左手，\"...难道这些血真的有用吗？\""}
{"time": 1751971955, "type": "recv", "message_id": "840696199", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=497931750]“……”沧澜不置可否，于她而言，地面上的一切都太过陌生，也包括人类"}
{"time": 1751971989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "942384117", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=497931750]“不……有更重要的事”蝴蝶突然想到了什么"}
{"time": 1751972028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1084421889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不要...解剖她”挡在沧澜身前"}
{"time": 1751972064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1860517198", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=114368117]“不知道，之前也没有这种情况吧……也许是我们这次运气不错，遇到个好苗子？”"}
{"time": 1751972139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "509179507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1084421889]“有病，谁跟你说这个了”蝴蝶没好气地按了按你的脑袋“重要的是，她遇上了什么，居然能把海龙伤成这个样子？”"}
{"time": 1751972176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "53617202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“啊，抱歉抱歉，我看话本看多了.”揉揉头"}
{"time": 1751972194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "975550447", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1860517198]\"嗯...那夏弥...要不要再...\"脸红，\"再补一点点铁..\""}
{"time": 1751972217, "type": "recv", "message_id": "90634627", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“之前认识的一个前辈猎人告诉我这两天离海远点，好像有什么大家伙”"}
{"time": 1751972368, "type": "recv", "message_id": "652876544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=975550447]“唔唔……这样补铁的话好心疼”她的手指轻柔地填满你左手的指隙“但是……可以补一点安”"}
{"time": 1751972451, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1153801365", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=90634627]“……古龙吗？海里的古龙……”蝴蝶坐回椅子里“但愿村子能安然无恙”"}
{"time": 1751972585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1344614170", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“海里的古龙吗？沧澜，你还记得那古龙有什么特点吗”"}
{"time": 1751972687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "88339348", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1344614170]“黑色……但是会发光，长着翅膀……”"}
{"time": 1751972698, "type": "recv", "message_id": "628703767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“还能，掌控海潮”"}
{"time": 1751972928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1417875587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“还有吗”期待的看着她"}
{"time": 1751972961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "695880046", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不大，但是会放电”"}
{"time": 1751972988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1164604493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“会不会放光束”"}
{"time": 1751973006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2019150982", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不会，为什么问这个？”"}
{"time": 1751973052, "type": "recv", "message_id": "583427008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“啊...我听说有的古龙有这种能力，感觉蛮帅的，所以比较好奇”"}
{"time": 1751973123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1455328258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“没有听说过这种怪物”蝴蝶摇摇头“学会的人应该懂的多些”"}
{"time": 1751973221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1429540192", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不过……沧澜，作为餐费……在你住在我这里休养的期间，我可以观察你吗？”"}
{"time": 1751973292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "540276146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=652876544]\"唔...为了夏弥，安可以的。\"咬咬嘴唇"}
{"time": 1751973394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "525656135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1429540192]“……请便。刚才的食物味道不错，还有吗？”沧澜点头，到现在为止，除了吃饭和吃痛的时候，她的表情几乎从没变过，你都要怀疑她是不是面瘫了"}
{"time": 1751973422, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1214714003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“还真是高冷啊”小声"}
{"time": 1751973480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1835276840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=540276146]“强买强卖啊，安……我不想看到你流血，哪怕是这一点点”"}
{"time": 1751973830, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1863714062", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=525656135]“还有，不过你能再给我看看你的盔甲吗？”"}
{"time": 1751973909, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1961564318", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“确实，那个好帅啊，怎么做到的”"}
{"time": 1751974152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "804222806", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1835276840]\"可是...试一试的话，也许夏弥会更强呢..\""}
{"time": 1751974157, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1328949707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1863714062]“嗯……”沧澜并没有做什么特别的动作，但盔甲就是在眨眼间出现在她身上，严丝合缝，犹如定制"}
{"time": 1751974162, "type": "recv", "message_id": "128075507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=60F7B8444FBCDF3F5CEA520C779ED0B9.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSh1Y78AC74YFfZ3yP4xQAIyL1jlBiqv0kg_wooqt3cq5StjgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQA89_agJ4g1MXFZYWz4U803oCM6g&amp;rkey=CAMSMEPt2Qt-BylRgI4CVJMNjPAh6E_sNJZ2fXIMMAaHS4CCsE-VD3rkzcfj323OP9vmCw,file_size=1204138]"}
