{"time": 1751976624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2147456303", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "但终究是遂了你的意，多半是知道于事无补，她红着眼轻轻吮吸着"}
{"time": 1751976633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "719760266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1963367695]（不是刚吃的早饭？）"}
