{"time": 1751978076, "type": "recv", "message_id": "558239415", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=573013951]“我好着呢”"}
{"time": 1751978129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "512487932", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“还是在观察观察吧，不过你能走路的话咱们就去吃饭吧，带你去吃好吃的”"}
{"time": 1751978146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "522040490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“oh，把那身衣服穿上记得”"}
{"time": 1751978403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1163825708", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她看了看你买的衣服，心念一动，身上的盔甲就变成了同款"}
{"time": 1751978417, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1788535661", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "但是一样的，侧身并没有覆盖到"}
{"time": 1751978459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "403671163", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好神奇，不过你这侧面不是还相当于没穿么”"}
{"time": 1751978517, "type": "recv", "message_id": "455389561", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1527639310]\"别这么看着我嘛...\"脸红，一副做错事的样子"}
{"time": 1751978602, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1462288798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=403671163]“偏偏只有伤处覆盖不到……”她皱眉"}
{"time": 1751978642, "type": "recv", "message_id": "865366542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你先好好穿着衣服吧，体验几天人类的生活”"}
{"time": 1751978731, "type": "recv", "message_id": "406401345", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=455389561]“唔唔……我要狠狠地生气，然后……盯着你把药喝完才理你……”"}
{"time": 1751978832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1830071819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=865366542]“行吧……不穿会怎么样？”"}
{"time": 1751978892, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2040934692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不穿...不穿容易着凉，而且女孩子的身体不能随便给别人看的”"}
{"time": 1751978920, "type": "recv", "message_id": "279305705", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2040934692]“我看你看得挺起劲的”"}
{"time": 1751978954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1479686083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不一样啊，之前没有条件，现在还是尽量穿着衣服吧”"}
{"time": 1751979105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1399735520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你要是想吃好吃的就听我话”叉腰挺胸"}
{"time": 1751979155, "type": "recv", "message_id": "968965055", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1479686083]她理了理这布条般的衣服，总算想明白怎么套在自己身上"}
{"time": 1751979282, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1359325381", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=406401345]她从你的衣服里翻出一瓶回复药g，塞到你手里，嘟着嘴竖着眉“安最近是不是越来越坏了，精力过剩的话，得好好熬一熬了”"}
{"time": 1751979349, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2118389897", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“沧澜真乖啊”踮起脚尖摸摸头，然后牵起她的手“走，吃好吃的去”"}
{"time": 1751979435, "type": "recv", "message_id": "757495502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1359325381]\"安怎么坏了....\"可怜巴巴地拧开盖子，小口小口喝，\"呃...好难喝\""}
{"time": 1751979611, "type": "recv", "message_id": "738260909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2118389897]那她不给你摸"}
{"time": 1751979624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1473846743", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "还顺手在你手背上进行一个拍"}
{"time": 1751979642, "type": "recv", "message_id": "463373167", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你干嘛...”"}
{"time": 1751979857, "type": "recv", "message_id": "377785296", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“算了..”但还是牵起她的手"}
{"time": 1751979878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "972291513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=757495502]“你……”夏弥被你噎住了“不管，我不高兴……一定是因为安”"}
