{"time": 1751981301, "type": "recv", "message_id": "854754287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你鼻子还挺灵”"}
{"time": 1751981361, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1330664255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1684968436]\"呜呜...安不胡闹了...之后都听夏弥的....不要生气..\"怯怯地开口，用手指戳戳她的肚子。"}
{"time": 1751981461, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1341653027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怎么了？我闻到这里头有很多肉，还有鱼……还有一些其他的怪物”"}
{"time": 1751981482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1439903029", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对了，不要在别人面前展示你的能力，还有不要给别人说你不是人”在她耳边小声的说"}
{"time": 1751981680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "943448426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1341653027][CQ:at,qq=825734198] “没什么，这家确实挺好吃的，你很有眼光”"}
{"time": 1751981749, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1480379534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1330664255]“真的？什么都听我的？”夏弥眨眨眼睛"}
{"time": 1751981949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "929893762", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1480379534]\"嗯...\"抬起头看着她，眼尾带一丝红肿，重重点头。"}
