{"time": 1751987752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "708465562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1174055407]“呼……”她伸出舌头，舔掉嘴角沾着的酱汁“不错……有因祸得福的感觉，”"}
{"time": 1751987827, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1067228392", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你开心就好”"}
{"time": 1751987836, "type": "recv", "message_id": "505916683", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1136639757]“我说别碰我！”她挥开你的手，努力从池子里站起来“你……从来没把我当成过同伴，只是玩物而已”"}
{"time": 1751987840, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1940732902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "结账"}
{"time": 1751987938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1181196583", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1940732902]共3400z，理所应当的，人鱼龙定食只占小头"}
{"time": 1751987976, "type": "recv", "message_id": "470763449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "花光了全部身家，这下真的一毛没有了"}
{"time": 1751988053, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1376679923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=505916683]\"诶?\"有些受伤，在池子里缩缩脑袋，\"你说话好冲...\"幽怨地看着她，\"安并没有这么想，想做一起旅行的同伴...\""}
{"time": 1751988168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "39647729", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1376679923]“方法就是为所欲为？”"}
